## Lists and Iteration

```jac
def:pub TodoList(items: list[dict[str, any]]) -> JsxElement {
    <ul>
        {[<li key={item["id"]}>{item["text"]}</li> for item in items]}
    </ul>
}

def:pub app() -> JsxElement {
    todos = [
        {"id": 1, "text": "Learn Jac"},
        {"id": 2, "text": "Build app"},
        {"id": 3, "text": "Deploy"}
    ];

    <TodoList items={todos} />
}
```

**Important:** Always provide a `key` prop for list items.

